            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"台股關禁閉規定鬆綁、緯創法說、7月CPI連三月衝破通膨警戒線 本周大事回顧\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b953941762753e743af3fdfb98d8656b2267430ad04df6234ade5b17c9ac94b0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Fe8d7fd204ac33c6b89a46a93c1d98e92\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">台股關禁閉規定鬆綁、緯創法說、7月CPI連三月衝破通膨警戒線 本周大事回顧</figcaption></div></figure></div>",
